<title>MALAYSIA: Chase Perdana 1996 net up 33.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Chase Perdana 1996 net up 33.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  11.59   vs	   8.71</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 26.0    vs	  23.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   225.67   vs	 141.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    21.25   vs	  14.09</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.21   vs  less   1.36</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Chase Perdana Bhd is in construction and property development businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
